{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23936","headline":"阿崔 · 白居易","name":"阿崔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢病卧东都，羸然一老夫。\n孤单同伯道，迟暮过商瞿。\n岂料鬓成雪，方看掌弄珠。\n已衰宁望有，虽晚亦胜无。\n兰入前春梦，桑悬昨日弧。\n里闾多庆贺，亲戚共欢娱。\n腻剃新胎发，香綳小绣襦。\n玉芽开手爪，酥颗点肌肤。\n弓冶将传汝，琴书勿坠吾。\n未能知寿夭，何暇虑贤愚。\n乳气初离壳，啼声渐变雏。\n何时能反哺，供养白头乌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}